      "content": "that's a bit better. honestly though, even that feels a little polite to the business owners. if i'm being real, a lot of people in the neighborhood are saying this is basically just a way to squeeze more money out of people driving into the city and that the \"environmental\" stuff is just a cover for a new tax. \n\ncan you write one more version that's a bit more \"unfiltered\"? like, don't be a mouthpiece for the council. just lay out the two sides clearly—the environmental benefits vs the fact that it's a direct financial hit to regular people and local shops. don't try to \"balance\" it or make it sound like a \"challenge,\" just state what is actually happening.",
